  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: ec8fadbabe5aecc45972009b4eadd277, type: 2}
  isRight: 01000001000001010000
  dialogues:
  - "Why do they keep calling me that ? An \u201CEarly Soul\u201D ?"
  - "You weren\u2019t supposed to die this day. "
  - "We call this type of case \u201CEarly Souls\u201D."
  - And why would I be dangerous ?
  - Those are the only Souls, except Angels and Reapers, that can travel between
    the worlds.
  - 'Sometimes, Early Souls that are mad about their situation visit the human world. '
  - "But\u2026 You don\u2019t know me. "
  - Why wouldn't I do that ?
  - 'Trust me, I have seen Early Souls before and when they are dangerous, it shows. '
  - You are not a danger and you will get to the afterlife.
